          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ikimazi ciwe co kwoswa ni caba ar’ ico mu mukuku, ar’ intama cank’ impene, az’ atange isuguru itagira agasembga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Az’ agikererere i ruhande y’igicaniro, ahahera i burārūko, imbere yanje; bene Aroni abaherezi bamijagire amaraso yaco ku gicaniro impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayijanjagure, ayishire mu bikenye vyayo, ashireko n’ umutwe wayo n’ibinure vyayo; umuherezi aheze abigereke ku nkwi ziri ku muriro kur’ ico gicaniro: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arikw amara n’ibikenye vy’amaguru abanze abironge mu mazi; maz’ umuherezi abihereze vyose, avyosereze kur’ ico gicaniro. Kizoba ar’ ikimazi coshejwe, ikimazi gitōngōwe n’umuriro, umubabge ummotera neza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
